symbol sizes
lines 0 37
hash 5ad7f4df64430a11
note Called by views::build before any panel is drawn. Each axis in turn: side panels share the window width with a 20-column centre, bottom panels share the height with 12 rows for the top bar, centre and status bar. Each panel gets what it asks for, clamped to a floor and to what is left after the floors of the panels after it. The stored size is never touched here, so a panel squeezed by a small window, or by a wide neighbour, grows back when there is room again.

