symbol drop_target
lines 0 70
hash ef65aaf664db4914
note Outside the body there is no target, so letting go over the top bar, the status bar or off the window cancels the move. Over the bottom panels or the bottom quarter of the dock row the edge is the bottom; otherwise the half the pointer is in picks left or right. The position is how many of that edge's other panels have their centre before the pointer, so dropping between two panels lands between them. The band is the size the panel will have there: its own when it stays on the same axis, the default otherwise.

